<title>FRANCE: Sanofi sees 10 pct profit rise for 1996.</title>
<headline>Sanofi sees 10 pct profit rise for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanofi, the pharmaceuticals subsidiary of Elf Aquitaine, reiterated on Monday that it expected a profit rise for 1996 of around 10 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;As previously stated, net income should show a progression of around 10 percent in relation to the previous year,&quot; Sanofi said in a statement detailing its 1996 turnover.</p>
<p>Its net profit for 1995 was 1.58 billion francs.</p>
<p>Sanofi first predicted a 10 percent profit increase for 1996 last June.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
